@startuml
[*] as InitialState
JourneyDetailsDisplayed as JourneyDetails
DrivingModeActivated as DrivingMode
PlaceSelectedForEating as PlaceToEat
AccidentOccurred as Accident
JourneyCompleted as Completed
SystemTerminated as Terminated

InitialState ->> JourneyDetails : User login and destination selection complete
JourneyDetails ->> (DrivingMode) : Activation of driving mode or other options chosen
JourneyDetails ->> (PlaceToEat) : Select a place to eat
(PlaceToEat) ->> OrderPlaced : Hunger detected (implied)
(PlaceToEat) ->> JourneyDetails : Cancel eating selection
(DrivingMode) ->> JourneyDetails : Deactivate driving mode or choose other options
JourneyDetails ->> Accident : Accident occurrence
Accident ->> SystemTerminated : Inform relevant authorities and terminate system
JourneyDetails ->> Completed : Completion of journey
Completed ->> SystemTerminated : Terminate system upon completion

[*] ->> JourneyDetails : [*]
JourneyDetails ->> DrivingMode : [*]
JourneyDetails ->> PlaceToEat : [*]
PlaceToEat ->> OrderPlaced : [*]
OrderPlaced ->> JourneyDetails : [*]
DrivingMode ->> JourneyDetails : [*]
Accident ->> SystemTerminated : [*]
Completed ->> SystemTerminated : [*]

@enduml
